        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FPV7178, 7\" Ornate Victorian Sliding Door Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 7 Inch Victorian Flush Pull is perfect for fancy homes. It is easy to install and is a great way to add an ornate touch to any sliding door. Flush Pulls like this one can also be used on lightweight cabinet doors, closets, and pocket doors. It is available in 4 finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available in a <a href=\"/products/victorian-10-inch-flush-pull-deltana-fpv10225\">10\" Victorian Flush Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Victorian Pocket Door Hardware:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Length: 4-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Height: 4-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Width: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Lip: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounts using 4 screws--2 on the top and 2 on the bottom.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FPV7178-specifications.pdf?v=1704262322\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FPV7178 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually<i>\r\n</p>",
